{"key":"07f41d8374cdedc8","source_file":"Potts An - Az.json","source_id":20593,"source_url":"concordance-antipathy-ppl-antipathia","term":"Antipathy","headwords":["Antipathy"],"latin":["Antipathia","Antipatheticus"],"header_pairs":[{"english":["Antipathy"],"latin":["Antipathia","Antipatheticus"]}],"header_sentences":[],"redirect_xref":null,"works":["AC","CL","DP","TCR"],"contexts":[{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"5061","subsection":"end"},"text":"Hatred... is aversion, and as it were spiritual antipathy.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"DP","section":"303","subsection":"end"},"text":"Hence are antipathy, aversion, and separation.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"171","subsection":null},"text":"Everything sympathetic and antipathetic takes its rise thence (from spheres). TCR 331.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"292","subsection":"2"},"text":"(Why some husbands feel such an antipathy for their wives inwardly, and such a sympathy outwardly.)","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"TCR","section":"365","subsection":"4"},"text":"Sympathies and antipathies are nothing but exhalations of affections from minds that affect another according to similitudes... and dissimilitudes.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"TCR","section":"578","subsection":null},"text":"Anything spiritual... felt as antipathetic...","comment":null,"footnote":null}],"slug":"antipathy","url":"/meta/potts/antipathy/"}